  Why: 'The owner''s paths carried round the island: 6 m inside the brows from the slip road to the bar-head road, over the Gap Brook and the Heath Brook on stepping stones. Round the head of the main beach by its key scene''s paint (keyscene.stp_main_beach, the package''s island.json sha256 61f8673f...: points (71.4, -64) to (12.5, -55.3)). Its first leg moved clear of the bait store (M8): (183, -6.5) and (181.7, -12.5) became (177, -7) and (177.6, -11.5), 1.71 m from the store''s footprint (drop 13''s tealShack, 4.12 x 5.5 m at (182.3, -8.8), door SE) and 10.2 m inside the brows there.'
